      <mj-text font-size="12px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="2px" color="#BF4512" padding="0 24px 8px">THE SNH NEWSLETTER</mj-text>
      <mj-text css-class="h1" font-size="34px" line-height="1.08" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" padding="0 24px 12px">Train <em style="font-family:'Instrument Serif', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;">smarter</em></mj-text>
      <mj-text font-size="17px" color="#5C574F" padding="0 24px 8px">{{ first_name|default:'there' }}, three reads from our team this month.</mj-text>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="8px 24px"><mj-column border="1px solid #E3DCD0" border-radius="14px" padding="0 0 14px"><mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0258/9625/5550/files/cricket.jpg?width=1200" alt="Clear whey vs regular whey" width="550px" border-radius="14px 14px 0 0" /><mj-text font-size="19px" font-weight="700" padding="14px 18px 4px">Clear whey vs regular whey</mj-text><mj-text color="#5C574F" padding="0 18px 6px">Which one suits your goal, your stomach and your budget.</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 18px"><a href="https://www.sportsnutritionhub.lk/blogs/news" class="lnk">Read more →</a></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="8px 24px"><mj-column border="1px solid #E3DCD0" border-radius="14px" padding="0 0 14px"><mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0258/9625/5550/files/running.jpg?width=1200" alt="Race-day fuelling with SiS" width="550px" border-radius="14px 14px 0 0" /><mj-text font-size="19px" font-weight="700" padding="14px 18px 4px">Race-day fuelling with SiS</mj-text><mj-text color="#5C574F" padding="0 18px 6px">How many gels, when, and how to practise it.</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 18px"><a href="https://www.sportsnutritionhub.lk/blogs/news" class="lnk">Read more →</a></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
<mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="8px 24px"><mj-column border="1px solid #E3DCD0" border-radius="14px" padding="0 0 14px"><mj-image src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0258/9625/5550/files/instore.webp?width=1200&format=pjpg" alt="How to read a protein label" width="550px" border-radius="14px 14px 0 0" /><mj-text font-size="19px" font-weight="700" padding="14px 18px 4px">How to read a protein label</mj-text><mj-text color="#5C574F" padding="0 18px 6px">Spot the real protein per serving and the fillers.</mj-text><mj-text padding="0 18px"><a href="https://www.sportsnutritionhub.lk/blogs/news" class="lnk">Read more →</a></mj-text></mj-column></mj-section>
